[32m+[m[32m2. Confirm your email address[m
[32m+[m[32m3. Form starts working immediately[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Q: Can I add comments to blog posts?**[m
[32m+[m[32mA: Yes! Add Disqus or Utterances by including their script in the post template.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Q: How do I customize blog colors?**[m
[32m+[m[32mA: Edit `/docs/css/blog.css` - change the `rgba(76, 175, 255, ...)` values to your colors[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Q: Can I use Markdown instead of HTML for blogs?**[m
[32m+[m[32mA: Yes! Use a static site generator like Hugo or Jekyll (requires setup).[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m**Q: How often do I update the copyright year in footer?**[m
[32m+[m[32mA: Automatically! The `<span id="year"></span>` script updates it.[m
